+- **Macros** — `Decay` 0.45, `FmIndex` 0.38, `WaveRcm` 0.25, `FormantHz` 0.42, `SkirtUnv` 0.30, `AlgRatio` 0.35, `FilterCut` 0.68, `ResoDac` 0.32.
